== fresh in XDG_BIN_HOME, not on PATH
editor: {{XDG_BIN_HOME}}/fresh
review tab: true

== no report.md
argv: ["{{XDG_BIN_HOME}}/fresh" "{{WORKSPACE}}/.mate/projects/shop/crews/k3"]
dir:  {{WORKSPACE}}/.mate/projects/shop/crews/k3
env:  ["PATH=/usr/bin:/bin"]

== report.md
argv: ["{{XDG_BIN_HOME}}/fresh" "{{WORKSPACE}}/.mate/projects/shop/crews/k3/report.md"]
dir:  {{WORKSPACE}}/.mate/projects/shop/crews/k3
env:  ["PATH=/usr/bin:/bin"]

== fresh not installed
error: a crew's report needs the Fresh editor: brew install fresh-editor
